  "sourceTitle": "Caramel Pecan Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Caramel Pecan Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 11:27pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup butter\n1 1/2 cups flour\n1/4 teaspoon salt\n1 cup firmly packed brown sugar\n1/2 cup white sugar\n1 egg\n1 teaspoon vanilla\nPecan halves\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients except pecan halves. Shape into small balls. Flatten on greased cookie sheet. Put pecan half on top of each cookie. Bake 10-12 minutes at 375 degrees. Makes about 3 dozen cookies.",
